Clipping Studio Database Migrations (Alembic)
==============================================

Folder ini mengelola migrasi skema database MySQL menggunakan Alembic.
Perintah dapat dijalankan via CLI Clipping Studio:
    ./clip migrate
    ./clip migrate --status
    ./clip migrate --rollback [N]
    ./clip migrate --target <rev>

Atau langsung menggunakan CLI Alembic:
    alembic upgrade head
    alembic downgrade -1
    alembic current
    alembic history
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "keterangan_migrasi"
